Z||000009||Ken Wittlief||06-14-2001||10:16 AM||||Its like that discussion we had on John Denver a while back. Everyone loved his music and his love songs - great stuff<P> till we found out he was sleeping around on his 'Lovely Wife Annie' and his marriage fell apart. Beautiful love songs are only touching if you know they are from a sincere heart.<P>   How many of you guys felt like you had been 'taken' when you found out all those great love songs Barry Manilow had been singing, he was singing about other guys - yuck yuck yuck!!!<P>  or elton john.<P>  Junkyard wars would be great if it were real (REAL real) - give them more time to brainstorm up ideas, give them a week to build their machines - but when they put the answers on the back of the exam paper its hard to take the challenge seriously.||||reg||1
